# AI Chat Exporter - Developer Guide

Welcome to the AI Chat Exporter development environment! This file helps you (and Claude) navigate the codebase.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Run tests
pnpm test

# Build extension
pnpm build

# Development mode (watch)
pnpm dev:chrome
```

